WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
The safety of the hostages is the most important thing

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:03,780
This is the first time the forces informed me

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:05,690
No matter what you think of it

4
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:07,690
There must not be any more casualties

5
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,490
The safety of these teachers and students must be ensured

6
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:11,170
The second step is to arrest these criminals

7
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,130
Is there any way to arrange for someone to secretly move forward?

8
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:17,460
Is there such a route or a dead end that I can take people on?

9
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,820
Cooperate with snipers

10
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,220
Just one or two people will do

11
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,940
Let's sneak in

12
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,340
Then launch a surprise attack at the same time as the sniper

13
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,020
In this case, we might be able to kill him in one fell swoop.

14
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:26,980
Fugitives rescue hostages

15
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:30,110
So cunning to prevent obscurity

16
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:31,510
They will definitely use the hostages as meat bombs.

17
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:33,550
Observe the situation outside and if any abnormalities are found,

18
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:35,270
I will definitely take action immediately

19
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:38,020
And they do call specifically

20
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,080
The classroom they occupied is located on the fourth floor

21
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,280
It happens to be the highest point

22
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,420
The best viewing angle of the classroom is from the corner window

23
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:48,100
You can directly observe the cave descent below

24
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:50,340
But we can't see them

25
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,260
Once the hostages are discovered, it will be in danger

26
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,420
This is an order from above

27
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:54,700
It is also our responsibility

28
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:55,780
Nothing can happen to anyone again

29
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:58,020
So what should I do now? Now I just drag it.

30
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,380
Negotiators have been notified and are on their way over.

31
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:07,190
They only gave us fifteen minutes to find a way to rescue the hostages.

32
00:01:08,620 --> 00:01:09,860
Go prepare the money and car they want

33
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:11,140
I can only delay this for fifteen minutes

34
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,460
The negotiator will be here soon

35
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:14,020
We can only wait for the negotiators to talk to them.

36
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:19,980
Let’s see if the doubts are alleviated. Anyway, money and cars have been prepared. I will give them if necessary, but I will try my best to get them to release the hostages.
